'''Eggblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Eggblade Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white with a multicolored diamond-cut pattern in the middle, along with ropes being tied around the whole blade. The guard is made up of a brown Easter basket full of eggs varying in different colors with a red bow attached to it. The handle is brown with an Easter egg as its pommel.                                                                                                                                                                

== Trivia ==
* It is the first Easter [[Godly Weapons|godly]].
*It replaced [[Heartblade]] in the shop, and was soon proceeded by [[Nebula]].
*It was [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] icon for a period of time.                                             
* It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].                                                                                                                                                                        

